        "guard:b5->n16"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Simultaneously, the stock is updated and the sales information is updated"
      ],
      "justification": "Structural split/converge and final path elements correctly route the simultaneous sales update alongside other terminal actions, preserving overall concurrent flow behaviour."
    }
